{
  "dom_id": "step-q161118",
  "name": "Question 17",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14128542/assets/8360f06b0d9e9633aa00b779702d386cd403d7fe8ac8a28b51922dca92ddafed.png)\n\nConsider the region $D$ in the $xy$-plane, shown above. The transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),\\,y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\nx=u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,y=u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\n$$\n\nmaps the region $Δ$ from the $uv$-plane to $D.$ Which of the following could be the region $Δ?$",
